<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 850 mln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate ops, shortage 850 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England called a round of fixed rate operations comprising repos to April 1 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before April 1.</p>
<p>The repo rate is 6.0 percent. The Bank of England revised its forecast of the shortage to 850 million stg down from the 900 million it had forecast earlier.</p>
</text>
